      "value": "@{5f2e0a4e8464150716ffd322|full_name}: \n\"If you wait for the avatar to pop up on the turntable in the menu, things seem to work fine.\"\nI know, but I feel like this shouldn't be an issue at all. Because of the habit I have of quickly switching into my main avatars, this sticks sometimes even when switching into my test avatars and sometimes I forget about that fact and end up inadvertently bugging my app, forcing me to restart VRChat.",
